n your armour, or finally find peace?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*Accessibility note:</strong> Instead of clicking, you can hover over objects and hit -Enter- to interact with them. Text can be advanced with -Space- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/screenshot-gif-1b.gif?t=1748500399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/st_cred.png?t=1748500399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a solo project with art, music, story, programming and sound design by ENDYSIS (me!) Thank you so much for checking out my game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special thank you to Wanpans Armoury for providing armour foley  and Sammy L. for moral support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/mirror-gif.gif?t=1748500399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/extras/st_snow.png?t=1748500399\" /></p>","developers":["ENDYSIS"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768420/header.jpg?t=1748500399","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</